  "version": "0.1.10",
  "notes": "### Added\n- Walk-in button on Reservations: new guest, booking, and check-in in one flow. The form opens on today's business date with source \"Walk-in\", and saving continues straight into check-in (room assignment if needed, early-fee window, then the balance gate).\n- \"New guest\" inside the reservation form, so a first-time guest never needs a trip to the Guests page.\n- Reservation search works: by confirmation number, first or last name, full name, email, phone, or room number. Pasting an exact confirmation number opens that reservation's details directly. The In-House tab searches too.\n- Balance column on the reservation list: \"Owes $X\", \"Paid to date\", \"Settled\", or \"Not posted\".\n\n### Changed\n- The Late Checkout time list starts at your property's checkout time instead of a fixed 11:00.\n- Settings → General shows the property's name, code, and check-in / check-out times (read-only; editing comes in a later release).",
